WEBVTT

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:07.820
Campanella-san, are we there yet?

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:09.280
Almost!

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:13.160
We're here.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:13.820
Is it ready?

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:20.020
<i>So this is...</i>

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:21.660
<i>"yen."</i>

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.940
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.880
<b>Episode 3: Hand-To-Mouth-Life</b>

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:56.180
Well?

00:01:56.180 --> 00:01:58.310
Surprisingly simple, wasn't it?

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:02.430
Yes, but we spent so much zel...

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:05.920
I actually got us a pretty good discount.

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:08.700
You should be very grateful to 
your beloved Campanella-san.

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:10.100
Right!

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.500
Thank you!

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:12.900
Don't worry about it.

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:16.190
But don't get too addicted.

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:18.740
Just like Erika-san said,

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:20.360
that's how you get dragged into bankruptcy.

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:21.900
Okay.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:23.700
I'll remember that.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:27.980
Aw, knowing you, you'll be fine!

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:29.950
It's true!

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:33.780
The house is supposed to be abandoned,

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:36.130
but every night, you can 
hear a girl sobbing.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:39.390
Cut it out!

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:40.680
It's unscientific!

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:41.550
It's nonsense!

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:43.750
And it definitely does not scare me!

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:45.000
What's up?

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:49.910
Gajeru heard a scary story from 
some of the neighborhood kids.

00:02:49.910 --> 00:02:52.530
It looks like he felt like he 
had to tell someone right away.

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:56.610
Of course, the way he's telling 
the story, it's not scary at all.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.700
So here's where it gets really scary!

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.200
Some people went into this 
mansion to test their courage...

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.940
S-Stop it!

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:06.660
One after another disappeared 
with a scream.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:07.650
Gajeru!

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:09.800
And when there was just one girl left,

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:13.580
a horde of ghosts began to chase her!

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:18.910
Ice Edge!

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:23.430
A quest?

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:27.770
Our client this time is Cursey Village.

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:31.110
Spirals have taken over a certain mansion,

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.940
and are scaring the villagers.

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:34.960
It's quiet, huh?

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:37.480
Nobody came to welcome us, either.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:41.400
It's less "quiet" than "creepy," isn't it?

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.560
It's overcast here, but it was 
a clear day on the walk over.

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:46.740
Let's start by finding the 
mayor and talking to him.

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.300
Is this the mayor's house?

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:02.160
Dude's got some crap taste.

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:03.440
Um...

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:05.890
How many times do I have to 
tell you, bubble brain?

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:08.850
You don't put ice in cola!

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:10.440
When it melts, it ruins the cola's flavor!

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:12.350
I'm sorry, boss!

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.300
Idiot.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:18.230
Who the hell are you?

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.150
If you want something, 
you can fizz right off!

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.660
Um, we're...

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:24.920
There's something weird about this village.

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:27.420
That mayor's got the same 
face as the last two,

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:29.120
and his puns are really bad.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:30.830
But it's always that way.

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:34.420
We're here about the spiral-slaying quest.

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:37.440
You got aspartame on the brain or something?

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:39.550
Some guys already came here to do the quest

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:42.130
and popped off to the mansion!

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:45.960
Three weirdos and their fizzin' monkey!

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:48.480
I gave 'em their drink money up front!

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:49.850
That's Wiseman!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:52.720
They always get in our way!

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:54.820
We'll go there, too!

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:56.950
W-Wait!

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:15.910
I am not going back in there! 
This place is the real deal!

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:17.200
Let's go home! Really, let's just go!

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.240
Let's go home, now!

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:21.090
U-Um, what's wrong?

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.310
You guys!

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.300
I didn't see this coming.

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:34.560
So there's something in this 
mansion that isn't a spiral?

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.060
That's right, guru!

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:38.770
I'm sure of it! This is a haunted house!

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.860
H-Haunted?!

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:47.260
We're gonna beat feet, so give 
this back to the villagers.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:49.360
You guys should leave, too!

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:50.400
Yeah.

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:54.120
Have a nice day!

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:56.870
I told you this place was weird!

00:05:56.870 --> 00:06:00.680
If we're not up against spirals, 
there's nothing we can do!

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:02.100
Let's get out of here!

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:04.090
No, we can't do that.

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:06.650
Whether it's a spiral or not,

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:08.440
if the villagers are in trouble,

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:09.840
we have to help.

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:13.810
And remember what you said, Liza?

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:17.000
Ghosts are unscientific!

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.060
Let's find out what's 
going on here together!

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:24.190
You dug your own grave.

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:37.410
Watch out!

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:41.010
Is this...?

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.500
We've been separated.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.440
Is anyone hurt?

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.200
We're fine!

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:48.450
What about Gajeru?

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:49.600
I'm fine, too!

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:51.970
Damn it! Who put this trap here?

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:55.550
I'll just have to go straight!

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:58.000
I'm going back to the lobby, 
and then to the second floor!

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:02.690
We'll... go this way.

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:04.280
Okay!

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:07.040
Liza, take care of Choco and Miu.

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:09.000
Okay, I'll take care of her.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:11.770
No, I didn't ask you.

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:17.100
Well, it's better than being alone.

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:19.460
Let's go, guys!

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:22.420
Wait for me!

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:23.630
Hey!

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:35.310
It looks like a normal room to me.

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:38.680
Get out.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.620
Did you say something?

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:46.150
Begone from this place!

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.820
No!

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:02.680
What was that?

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:04.430
What the hell was that?

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:06.880
Miss Memes is gone, too.

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:11.090
One after another disappeared 
with a scream.

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:16.260
Begone from this place!

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:18.480
Get out!

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:20.140
Get out!

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:21.960
I'd love to!

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:24.460
But I can't find the exit!

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:27.860
Haru!

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:32.150
No...

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:36.010
What do I do now?

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:37.810
I'm all alone.

00:08:40.090 --> 00:08:42.500
Every night, you can hear a girl sobbing.

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:55.920
Is it coming from that room?

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:09.060
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:17.330
Even periods go down easy 
if you catch them off guard.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:19.670
Who would've thought they'd 
fall for a pit trap like that?

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:21.640
Now it's just the two girls?

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:26.970
Just like the others, scare the hell 
out of them and then send them away.

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:29.830
If it becomes known as a mansion 
too scary for even periods,

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:32.050
nobody at all will come here.

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:36.560
This is for the sake of the village's future.

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:41.600
A girl?

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:48.430
Please, help me!

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:51.110
What's this?

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:55.320
Then you live here?

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:59.950
But aren't you scared to be alone?

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:01.230
I'm not.

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:03.560
But I'm sad.

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:04.410
Sad?

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:07.120
This village is going to change.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:09.120
More and more people are 
coming to this mansion.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:14.090
But we just want to live in peace.

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:17.550
That... makes me sad.

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:24.000
Don't cry.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.180
I don't know what's going on, but...

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:29.440
Is there some secret in this mansion?

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:33.930
I want you to find it!

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.400
Please! I know you can do it!

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:39.240
And if you do, this village will...

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.450
It's such an honor!

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:47.200
This wonderful offer you're 
making our village...

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:49.920
<b>Boss</b>

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:50.200
I'm so honored! I'm foamy with gratitude!

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:53.500
<b>Boss</b>

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:52.620
It's all thanks to you, mayor.

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:53.500
<b>He's just flattering you, though</b>

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:57.600
No, it's all thanks to you two, 
and your company, Happy Elements,

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:58.950
which rules over all the Six Powers!

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:02.220
You guys are the best-testing admins around!

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:06.210
You really care about the users!

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:10.060
<b>Thank him, not me</b>

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.180
Yeah...

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:19.530
He accepted our plans for a collaboration
 theme park without any complaints at all.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:22.520
That's certainly a true flavor!

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:28.080
You'll be remembered forever as an
 honorary member of our village's six pack!

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.360
A lot of the planned attractions 
are very good, too.

00:11:31.360 --> 00:11:33.840
Yes, cola! Electrical Cotton Drifting.

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:35.340
Garbage Pile Near the Old Dam Mountain.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.420
Let's Play With the Cleaver Lady!

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:41.260
Every one of them reflects the 
taste of the original work.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:48.050
Some people are talking about changing 
the brand name of this village to Hinamizawa!

00:11:48.050 --> 00:11:49.320
But...

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:53.310
It seems the construction 
work is falling behind.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:56.190
The groundbreaking should've 
started a long time ago.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:12:02.030
<b>Boss</b>

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:59.280
We'll be starting on the 
cola-boration real soon now!

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:01.460
We just have to wait for 
the fizz to die down.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.030
<b>By the way, what's with the soda puns?</b>

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.110
They're the cola in our collaboration.

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:05.820
That's bad, and you should feel bad.

00:12:09.470 --> 00:12:11.980
Not a fizz from the periods yet?

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:12.990
Yes.

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:16.880
No word from the first group or the second.

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:22.340
The plan was to use that story about a 
spiral infestation to make 'em empty their cans.

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:27.370
The construction workers are still 
refusing to go anywhere near the mansion.

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:32.240
Once that mansion's gone flat,
 we can start work immediately!

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:36.230
We need to pop the tab on this 
job before Happy Elements

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:38.520
and the dragon knight change their minds!

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:40.730
There's the mayor!

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:43.950
Furude-san!

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:45.410
Is something wrong?

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.600
This is for you!

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:53.500
Is this ohagi stuffed with needles, cola?

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.460
Mii! It is not.

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:58.290
Steamed buns?

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:06.320
Tabasco!

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:13.250
Don't worry!

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:16.640
We'll deal with the ones who 
are getting in your way!

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:17.810
Nipah!

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:27.700
How am I supposed to solve 
the mystery of this mansion?

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.160
I want to help her out, but...

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:38.980
Get out.

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:42.050
Begone from this place!

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:47.260
If you don't leave, untold 
disasters will befall you!

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:50.210
I can't do that!

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:52.970
There's a reason I can't leave now!

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:56.180
Watch out!

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:02.200
What was that voice?

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:04.900
Almost got her!

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:07.860
G-Ghosts?!

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:10.680
And when there was just one girl left,

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:14.200
a horde of ghosts began to chase her!

00:14:15.550 --> 00:14:18.280
Yes! We are scary ghosts!

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:23.130
Begone from this place, living one!

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:29.310
And tell everyone that this mansion is ours!

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:32.950
That none may touch it!

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:37.500
If I run here...

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:41.840
I can't save the others,

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:44.070
and I can't keep my promise to that girl.

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:46.250
I am a period,

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:48.660
and this is a job that only I can do!

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:53.530
I don't care if you're ghosts! 
I won't do as you say!

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:56.610
So you insist on interfering...

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:57.860
Fool!

00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:00.100
Then prepare to die!

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:09.140
Good work, yo-yo.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:11.930
Meme girl!

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:14.890
I know what these ghosts are.

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:16.640
They're just people.

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:17.600
Humans?

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:20.190
They found out? Fine!

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:22.400
Let's get rid of them all!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.150
If you're not ghosts,

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:27.260
then I'm not scared of you!

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:29.280
Ice Edge!

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:37.590
You're the mayor!

00:15:37.590 --> 00:15:38.560
Why?

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:41.070
Nope.

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:42.960
That's his little brother.

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.290
Little brother?

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:46.290
I see.

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:48.510
They're building a collaboration park, huh?

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:54.560
So you made up the story about ghosts to 
keep the mansion from being torn down, huh?

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:55.990
Yes.

00:15:55.990 --> 00:15:59.180
If we made it so the construction 
workers were too scared to start,

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:00.750
they wouldn't be able to build the park.

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:06.840
The mayor lied and said there were spirals 
here to hire you to get rid of us.

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:08.100
What?

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:10.020
He's your brother, right?

00:16:10.020 --> 00:16:14.040
My brother will do anything to 
make the village rich and famous.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.660
But none of the villagers want that!

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:21.420
No sane person would go to a 
collaboration theme park anyway!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.130
This is just his opinion.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:29.220
So that's what she meant by 
"this village will change."

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:33.930
But making up stuff about a ghost 
when there are people living here...

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.470
Don't you think the way you're 
doing things is wrong, too?

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:38.050
Living here?

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:40.170
You know, that girl.

00:16:40.170 --> 00:16:41.720
The one in the room back there.

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:45.310
Hello, everyone. Are you all bubbling here?

00:16:47.660 --> 00:16:49.130
Is that the mayor?

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.480
He's got the same voice, though.

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:54.940
Brother, knock it off!

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:57.300
We don't need a collaboration theme park!

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:59.970
That's what all the villagers say, too!

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:04.120
All you see is the can right in front of you!

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:07.040
If we don't try to do new 
things to adapt to a new era,

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.170
the village will someday be flat and empty!

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.170
But that doesn't mean—

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:12.700
That's enough fizz from you!

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:16.220
You're all going to be poured out here!

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:31.320
They're all four or five stars...

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:34.520
Surprised, cola?

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:36.480
How are you gonna fizz now?

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:42.920
Can you even touch my party of 
cola-boration event characters?

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:44.830
He's got us there.

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:47.120
I don't understand,

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:49.840
but I do think that it's wrong to fight them!

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:57.150
Nipah!

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:58.410
Nipah.

00:17:58.410 --> 00:17:59.120
Unyu.

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:00.290
Unyu.

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:02.700
What are you doing?

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:04.520
Don't worry.

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:07.420
Once you're all dead, I'll leave your bodies 
in this mansion when it's torn down.

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:10.920
Your bodies will form the 
foundation of the cola-boration theme park!

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:18.320
Hold it, guru!

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:22.780
What the fizz?!

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:25.500
Wiseman!

00:18:25.730 --> 00:18:27.140
Wiseman?!

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.580
I thought you left!

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:30.780
It was bugging us, so we came back, guru!

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:33.000
We heard everything.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:35.400
We can't let the mayor get away with this!

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:36.410
Yeah, yeah!

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:39.620
Just this once, we'll help the periods, guru!

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:44.490
It doesn't matter how many of you there are.
 You're all characters from this world.

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:47.480
You can't touch a cola-boration 
event character!

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.110
Then what if we do this?

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:49.960
Luluna!

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:51.100
Right...

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:52.590
That's...

00:18:58.440 --> 00:19:00.450
Why? Why, cola?!

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:03.360
A collaboration for a collaboration.

00:19:03.360 --> 00:19:04.910
A Higurashi for a Higurashi.

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:05.620
This can't be!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:06.700
It sure can, guru!

00:19:07.650 --> 00:19:09.790
She's still just one can alone!

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:11.560
If you all attack...

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:16.970
Mii.

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:18.990
Sorry.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:21.340
We can't fight Rena.

00:19:21.710 --> 00:19:22.950
Cola?

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:27.180
We overcame a tragedy with our 
unwavering, believing hearts.

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:29.690
We don't want to fight.

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:30.940
Bye!

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:33.590
W-Wait, cola!

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:35.630
What about the cola-boration theme park?!

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:37.360
What about the attractions?

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:42.000
Looks like it's back to 
the drawing board for you.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:46.210
You're going to pay for trying 
to use periods for a fake quest.

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:48.040
You need some punishment, huh?

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:54.630
That sure surprised me!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:57.730
We woke up, and it was all over!

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:00.120
You're amazing, Liza!

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:02.690
Sheesh! This better not happen again.

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:04.950
What would've happened if I wasn't here?

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:06.510
Please, cola!

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:22.280
<b>Boss</b>

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:09.800
Let us build the collaboration theme park!

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:12.850
But it looks like you don't 
have the village's support.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:15.690
We'll have to start over from scratch.

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:17.160
Cola!

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:19.820
There's other villages were looking at, too.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:21.230
Anyway, I've got a live broadcast, so...

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:22.090
Bye.

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:24.070
No!

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:25.000
Who's that?

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:27.660
Some happy people.

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:31.040
Are you sure you can't accept it?

00:20:31.320 --> 00:20:34.500
Yes, we already got our money for the quest.

00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:36.740
I worked pretty hard to earn it though.

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:37.980
Now, now.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:39.090
It's okay.

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:42.910
But we insist.

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:45.740
If there's anything else we can give you..

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:53.020
A Miracle Jumbo Hope Raffle Ticket?

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:54.760
What's that doing here?

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:56.690
If you win, you'll get a ton of zel.

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:59.760
Um, this is all the thanks we need.

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:02.280
No, but the odds of you winning are so low!

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:03.880
And it's just one ticket!

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:05.110
It's fine.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:09.080
Use that zel to protect the 
forest around the village.

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:12.660
Thank you!

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:16.740
I wanted to say goodbye 
to that girl in the end.

00:21:16.740 --> 00:21:18.490
But I didn't get to see her.

00:21:18.490 --> 00:21:19.880
What girl?

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:22.080
The one who lived in the mansion.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:24.010
I managed to keep my promise to her.

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:27.240
But they said that mansion had 
been abandoned for decades...

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:29.000
Yeah, they did.

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.850
There's no way there were any kids there.

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:35.810
Then the girl I met was...

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:39.060
The real thing?

00:21:43.010 --> 00:21:46.340
I hate ghosts!

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:44.990
Liza?!

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:53.580
Thanks, miss.

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Episode 4
"Rich in Zel"</b>

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:36.660 --> 00:23:38.260
"Rich in Zel."
